# Keep the build context small and free of secrets / local state.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/*.user
**/.idea/
.git/
.github/
.devcontainer/
.aspire/
.claude/
.nmbl/
.env
**/.env
**/node_modules/
**/TestResults/

# Not needed to build the Web image
tests/
docs/
infra/
deploy/
**/*.md
azure-pipelines.yml
docker-compose*
src/PublicApi/
src/eShopWeb.AppHost/
# Committed sample data-protection key - never bake keys into images
src/Web/key-*.xml
